  "releaseNotes": "- PickList uses the shared search field and List background, with controlled input synchronization.\n\t\t\t- PickList searching and clearing preserve the state of a containing EditForm.\n\t\t\t- List and PickList use consistent spacing, aligned controls and responsive pagination.\n\t\t\t- Form clear actions use a subtle outlined circle with an X.\n\t\t\t- Tabs add configurable inner padding, and Stepper examples provide a padded action footer.\n\t\t\t- Checkboxes and radio buttons add 10px between indicators and text while preserving unlabeled controls.\n\t\t\t- Targets .NET 11 RC2.",
